 nevada state law  requires medical malpractice be reported  but not the type of harm that's related  to it he's being protected by the  medical board  not given consequences in my eyes it's  so upsetting  it was  it was just beyond my belief page's  family sued dr gordon the board's  website lists a 950 thousand dollar  settlement we reached out to the  attorney who represented dr gordon for  his cases with the medical board and did  not receive a response by deadline dr  gordon's cosmetic surgery practice  closed and according to the medical  board's website he was working at a burn  center at sunrise hospital a spokeswoman  for sunrise says his medical staff  privileges there ended last year vanessa  murphy live local now  in 2018 a task force of medical  societies issued a warning about  brazilian butt lifts that procedure is  considered the most dangerous kind of  cosmetic surgery with an estimated death  rate of at least one in 3 000 that  warning came just a few months after  paige hazelton died
 

